# Denali first customer (P6)

Close **end-to-end Denali product** for the first club — three **separate apps** on **separate subdomains**, guest journey **before** full admin polish.

**Not in P6:** metadata cutover, gateway/commerce (P5-C/D/E), Urban, installments.

---

## Three apps (frozen — dual addressing)

**Authority:** [p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc](p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc) · runbook [host-subdomain-map.md](p6/runbooks/host-subdomain-map.md)

### Platform default (provision)

| Surface | App | Dev (canonical) | Prod |
| ------- | --- | --------------- | ---- |
| **Public** | `apps/marketing` | `{club}.localhost:3002` | `https://{club}.{root}` |
| **User** | `apps/portal` | `{club}.portal.localhost:3003` | `https://{club}.portal.{root}` |
| **Admin** | `apps/web` `(app)/` | `{club}.admin.localhost:3000` | `https://{club}.admin.{root}` |

### Custom apex (per club — production white-label)

| Surface | Example |
| ------- | ------- |
| Public | `https://denali.club` |
| User | `https://portal.denali.club` |
| Admin | `https://admin.denali.club` (target; ingress via `tenant_domains` + platform subdomain) |

**Dev legacy smoke** (still supported): `shop.{club}.localhost:3002` · `{club}.localhost:3003` · `{club}.localhost:3000`.

All surfaces resolve the **same `tenantId`** via `GET /public/tenant-context` (platform parse → `tenant_domains`).

**Workspace isolation:** clubs do not share domains; Denali/Urban is `pluginId` after tenant lookup — not encoded in cross-club hostnames.

---

## Problem (pre-P6)

Admin routes mostly existed but **flows did not connect** (fixed in P6 v2.1).

```text
Admin builds tour  ✗→  Public catalog empty/wrong tenant   [FIXED P6-0 + P6-1]
                   ✗→  Portal register unreachable          [FIXED P6-1]
                   ✗→  Member /me missing                  [FIXED P6-3]
```

**Closure:** `pnpm run p6:gate` · see [platform-denali-vertical-slice.mdoc](platform-denali-vertical-slice.mdoc).

