## Frozen rules

| ID | Rule |
| -- | ---- |
| R-01 | Workspace `@app-tour/workspace-denali` only |
| R-02 | `offline_receipt` only |
| R-03 | Admin wizard in `apps/web` — not Super Admin |
| R-04 | Do not delete `denali/src/rules` or `composites` |
| R-05 | Three apps — do not merge public/register into `apps/web` long-term |
| R-06 | Package binding OK — metadata cutover not required for customer 1 |
| R-07 | **Theming:** [p6-theming-file-tree.md](p6/p6-theming-file-tree.md) |
| R-08 | **Addressing:** [p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc](p6-host-addressing-architecture.mdoc) — platform `{club}.{root}` + custom apex per tenant; three surfaces; no cross-club hosts |

Safety: [p6-denali-safety.md](p6/p6-denali-safety.md)

